{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Capes, Cloaks & Robes|Bat Wi$ng}}

A Bat Wing cape, not to be confused with [[Bat Wings]] (curiosity), is a [[Cape]] made with bat materials. It is the only cape which is also an armor piece.

Bats will not aggro you while wearing a Bat Wing cape, making it very useful in navigating caves.

*10-30% [[Special:SearchByProperty/:Egildatt/Stealth|Stealth]] gilding slot.

==Quality==

* Quality Formula: <math>\frac{_{q}BatHide + _{q}BatWings+ _{q}String}{3}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Dexterity*Sewing}</math>

